ConjectureA
Lean 4 proofs of Applegate-Lagarias Conjecture A and the 3x+1 Growth Exponent
Conjecture for the 3x+1 (Collatz) problem.
Copyright 2026 Naoufal El Jaouhari.

The files ConjectureA.lean, ConjectureAZ.lean, GrowthExponent.lean, the
ThreeXMinusOne/ directory, Verification.lean and Verification/ConjectureAExact.lean
are original to this repository and are licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). Generative AI (Anthropic Claude, via Claude Code) contributed
substantially to writing these proofs.

This repository also redistributes, byte-for-byte unmodified, Lean source files
from two Apache-2.0 packages released on ProofAtlas:

  * "Explicit Positive-Density Collatz Convergence in Logarithmic Time",
    source package version 2.1 (the Erdos1135/ and FormalConjectures/ trees).
    Its copyright and attribution notices are reproduced unchanged in
    UPSTREAM/M1/NOTICE, together with its README, RIGHTS.md, license.json and
    source manifests.

  * "Positive Lower Density of Collatz Predecessors" (CollatzPredecessorDensity.lean,
    Erdos1135/StoppingTime.lean and ten modules under Erdos1135/ND/PositiveDensity/).
    Its copyright and attribution notices are reproduced unchanged in
    UPSTREAM/M2/NOTICE, together with its README, RIGHTS.md, license.json and
    source manifests.

The retained file under FormalConjectures/ keeps its original attribution:
Copyright 2025 The Formal Conjectures Authors, Apache License, Version 2.0.

Mathlib and the other pinned dependencies are not redistributed here and retain
their own license and attribution terms.

`scripts/verify_upstream.py` checks every vendored upstream file against the
SHA-256 recorded in the upstream manifests.
